  "body": "**Link to problem area**: https://spec.matrix.org/unstable/client-server-api/#post_matrixclientv3keysupload\r\n\r\n**Issue**\r\n`fallback_keys` and `one_time_keys` are defined as `OneTimeKeys`. This type is not defined in the client-server spec.\r\n\r\nThere are no mandatory keys for `OneTimeKeys`. I expect this confuses our go template langauge machinery.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-spec/blob/dcc1f4adee2be41069045ddbf3ef913e9c19d116/data/api/client-server/definitions/one_time_keys.yaml#L1-L24\r\n\r\n",
